{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10020","headline":"晓入宜都渚 · 阎宽","name":"晓入宜都渚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"问俗周楚甸，川行眇江浔。\n兴随晓光发，道会春言深。\n回眺佳气象，远怀得山林。\n伫应舟楫用，曷务归闲心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"阎宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}